+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| MPEP/CFR 1.77 | H | M | H | H (US practice) | L | H | H (public) | M |
+| Claim drafting model | H | H | H | H | L | H | H | M |
+| Application DTDs | H | M–H | L | H | L | M | H | L–M |
+| OA guidance | M | L | M | H | L | H | H | H |
